{"canonicalKey":"emotion.allow_without_obeying","contentHash":"b6bb1070d7c7212af87efa23f8c8cc359eb72cbbe1f4864a182be400476c1025","contentType":"original_synthesis","formalTheoryChunk":false,"schemaVersion":"xinzhili.chunk-preview.v1","sourceKind":"card","status":"draft","text":"接纳情绪不等于服从情绪。允许情绪存在，是减少内耗并听取信息；它不等于按冲动行动，也不取消边界和责任。"}
